---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: My library
permalink: /account/
description: Your reading, badges, and profile on the WVSU Journal for Law Advocacy.
searchExclude: true
---
<section class="lib acct" id="acct"><div class="wrap">

  {#- ===== the header: who you are (or how to sign in) ===== -#}
  <header class="lib-hero">
    <div class="lib-me" data-when="in" hidden>
      <label class="ap-photo" title="Change photo">
        <img alt="" width="88" height="88" hidden><span class="monogram" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <input type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><span class="ap-edit">Change</span>
      </label>
      <div class="lib-id">
        <h1 class="ap-name">My library</h1>
        <p class="ap-school"></p>
        <p class="ap-streak"></p>
      </div>
      <p class="lib-hero-acts"><a href="#settings" data-goto="settings">Edit profile</a><a data-public-link hidden>Public profile</a></p>
    </div>

    <div data-when="out" hidden>
      <div class="signin">
        <div class="si-seal" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="48"/></svg>
          <img src="/assets/img/seal-240.png" alt="" width="64" height="64">
        </div>
        <span class="si-eyebrow">Reader account · free</span>
        <h1 class="si-title">Your library, <em>everywhere</em></h1>
        <ul class="si-perks">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5.5h7v13H4zM13 5.5h7v13h-7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Pick up where you left off, on any device</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3c1 3.5 5 5.2 5 10a5 5 0 0 1-10 0c0-2.2 1-3.6 2.3-4.8.3 1.6 1 2.6 2.2 3C11 8.6 11.2 5.6 12 3z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Weekly reading streaks and badges</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5h14v10H9l-4 4z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Highlights, private notes and discussion</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="si-card" aria-live="polite">
          {#- step 1: choose how to sign in -#}
          <div data-si="start">
            <div class="si-inapp" hidden>
              <p><b>You're reading inside <span data-app>an app</span>.</b> Google doesn't allow signing in here. Open this page in your browser, or use your email below.</p>
              <p class="si-row"><a class="si-btn si-small" data-open-browser hidden>Open in Chrome</a><button class="si-btn si-small si-ghost" type="button" data-copy-link>Copy link</button></p>
            </div>
            <div data-google-wrap>
              <button class="si-google" type="button" data-google>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.5 0 6.6 1.2 9.1 3.6l6.8-6.8C35.8 2.4 30.3 0 24 0 14.6 0 6.6 5.4 2.6 13.3l7.9 6.1C12.4 13.7 17.7 9.5 24 9.5z"/><path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.1 24.6c0-1.6-.1-3.1-.4-4.6H24v9h12.4c-.5 2.9-2.2 5.3-4.6 6.9l7.4 5.8c4.3-4 6.9-9.9 6.9-17.1z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.5 28.7A14.5 14.5 0 0 1 9.5 24c0-1.6.3-3.2.9-4.7l-7.9-6.1A24 24 0 0 0 0 24c0 3.9.9 7.5 2.6 10.7l7.9-6z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.5 0 11.9-2.1 15.9-5.8l-7.4-5.8c-2.1 1.4-4.8 2.2-8.5 2.2-6.3 0-11.6-4.2-13.5-10l-7.9 6.1C6.6 42.6 14.6 48 24 48z"/></svg>
                <span>Continue with Google</span>
              </button>
              <div class="si-or"><span>or</span></div>
            </div>
            <form class="si-email" data-email novalidate>
              <label for="email">Email address</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="you@example.com">
              <p class="si-hint" data-typo hidden></p>
              <button class="si-btn" type="submit"><span>Email me a sign-in link</span></button>
            </form>
            <p class="si-fine">No password needed. By continuing you agree to the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> and the <a href="/community/">community guidelines</a>.</p>
          </div>

          {#- step 2: the link is on its way -#}
          <div data-si="sent" hidden>
            <div class="si-envelope" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect x="6" y="14" width="52" height="36" rx="5"/><path d="M8 17l24 18 24-18"/></svg></div>
            <h2 class="si-h">Check your inbox</h2>
            <p class="si-p">We sent a sign-in link to <b data-sent-to></b>. Open it on this device to finish.</p>
            <p class="si-row"><a class="si-btn si-small" data-open-mail target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Open Gmail</a><button class="si-btn si-small si-ghost" type="button" data-resend>Resend</button></p>
            <p class="si-fine">Not there? Look in Spam or Promotions. <button class="si-link" type="button" data-change-email>Use a different email</button></p>
          </div>

          {#- opened the link on another device: confirm the address (instead of a pop-up prompt) -#}
          <div data-si="confirm" hidden>
            <h2 class="si-h">One more step</h2>
            <p class="si-p">For your security, type the email address you asked the link for.</p>
            <form class="si-email" data-confirm novalidate>
              <label for="email-confirm" class="sr">Email address</label>
              <input id="email-confirm" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="you@example.com">
              <button class="si-btn" type="submit"><span>Finish signing in</span></button>
            </form>
          </div>

          {#- working -#}
          <div data-si="busy" hidden>
            <span class="si-spin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p class="si-p" data-busy-text>Signing you in…</p>
          </div>

          <p class="si-msg" role="alert"></p>
        </div>
        <p class="si-local">Not ready? Your reading still counts on this device.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-when="off" hidden>
      <h1 class="lib-title">My library</h1>
      <p class="lib-sub">Your reading is counted and saved on this device.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  {#- ===== the numbers ===== -#}
  <div class="lib-stats" data-stats>
    <div><b data-s="finished">0</b><span>read</span></div>
    <div><b data-s="streak">0</b><span>week streak</span></div>
    <div><b data-s="badges">0</b><span>badges</span></div>
    <div><b data-s="words">0</b><span>words</span></div>
    <span hidden data-s="inProgress"></span><span hidden data-s="unread"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="overall"><span class="pbar big"><i data-overall></i></span><p data-overall-text></p></div>

  {#- ===== tabs ===== -#}
  <nav class="lib-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="My library">
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab-btn="reading" aria-selected="true">Reading</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab-btn="highlights" aria-selected="false">Highlights</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab-btn="badges" aria-selected="false">Badges</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab-btn="author" aria-selected="false" hidden>Author</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab-btn="board" aria-selected="false" hidden>Board</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab-btn="settings" aria-selected="false">Settings</button>
  </nav>

  {#- Reading -#}
  <section class="lib-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab="reading">
    <div data-block="continue" hidden>
      <h2 class="lib-h">Continue reading</h2>
      <div class="next-list" data-continue></div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="lib-h">Read next</h2>
    <div class="next-list" data-next></div>
    <aside class="write-cta">
      <span class="eyebrow">From reader to author</span>
      <p data-write-line>Every article here began as a student's question. Yours could be in the next volume.</p>
      <p class="lib-links"><a href="/submit/">How to submit →</a><a href="/call-for-papers/">Call for papers →</a></p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  {#- Highlights -#}
  <section class="lib-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab="highlights" hidden>
    <div data-block="highlights" hidden><div class="hl-list" data-highlights></div></div>
    <p class="lib-empty" data-hl-empty>Select any sentence in an article and choose <b>Highlight</b> or <b>Note</b>. Your highlights and private notes collect here.</p>
  </section>

  {#- Badges -#}
  <section class="lib-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab="badges" hidden>
    <p class="lib-note" data-badge-sum></p>
    <ul class="badge-list" data-badges></ul>
  </section>

  {#- Author (approved authors and pending claims) -#}
  <section class="lib-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab="author" hidden>
    <div class="author-box" id="author" data-author-box hidden>
      <div data-author-pages></div>
      <ul class="claim-list" data-claims></ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {#- Board (editors) -#}
  <section class="lib-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab="board" hidden>
    <div class="board-box" data-board hidden>
      <p class="lib-note">You're an editor: you can hide or delete comments in any discussion.</p>
      <ul class="lib-menu">
        <li><a href="/editor/moderation/"><b>Moderation</b><span>Reported comments, muted readers, the log</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/editor/outreach/"><b>Author outreach</b><span>Invite past authors to claim their pages, and track who has been reached</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/editor/claims/"><b>Author claims</b><span>Approve readers who claim author pages</span><span class="dk-count" data-claim-count hidden></span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/editor/announce/"><b>Send an announcement</b><span>New volume or call for papers, to readers who opted in</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/editor/editors/"><b>Manage editors</b><span>Who can moderate and announce</span></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {#- Settings -#}
  <section class="lib-panel" role="tabpanel" data-tab="settings" hidden>
    <div class="lib-group" data-when="in" hidden>
      <h2 class="lib-h">Profile</h2>
      <form data-profile>
        <div class="field"><label for="pf-name">Name</label><input id="pf-name" name="name" maxlength="80" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="pf-school">School or office <small>(also shown on your author page)</small></label><input id="pf-school" name="school" maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. WVSU College of Law, 2L"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="pf-bio">Bio</label><textarea id="pf-bio" name="bio" maxlength="600" rows="4" placeholder="A few lines about you and your work. If you are a published author, this also appears on your author page."></textarea></div>
        <label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="public"> Show my profile, badges and reading count publicly</label>
        <div class="acts"><button class="btn sm" type="submit">Save profile</button></div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="lib-group push-box" data-push-box hidden>
      <h2 class="lib-h">Notifications</h2>
      <ul class="toggles">
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" value="volumes"> <span><b>New volume published</b><small>When a new volume goes online.</small></span></label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" value="replies"> <span><b>Replies to my comments</b><small>When someone replies to you in a discussion.</small></span></label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" value="cfp"> <span><b>Calls for papers</b><small>When the Journal opens a call for submissions.</small></span></label></li>
        <li><label><input type="checkbox" value="streak"> <span><b>Weekly reading reminder</b><small>Saturday morning, only if you haven't read that week.</small></span></label></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="msg push-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="lib-group app-box" data-app-box hidden>
      <h2 class="lib-h">App &amp; offline</h2>
      <p class="lib-note" data-app-line>Put the Journal on your home screen. It opens full screen and keeps your saved articles for reading offline.</p>
      <div class="acts"><button class="btn sm" type="button" data-install data-install-btn hidden>Install the app</button><a class="btn sm alt" href="/app/" data-install-how>How to install</a></div>
      <div data-saved-wrap hidden>
        <h3 class="app-h">Saved for offline</h3>
        <ul class="saved-list" data-saved></ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lib-group" data-when="in" hidden>
      <h2 class="lib-h">Your data</h2>
      <p class="lib-note">See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p>
      <div class="acts">
        <button class="btn sm alt" type="button" data-export>Download my data</button>
        <button class="btn sm alt" type="button" data-signout>Sign out</button>
        <button class="btn sm danger" type="button" data-delete>Delete my account</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lib-empty" data-when="out" hidden>Sign in (above) to edit your profile and choose notifications.</p>
  </section>
</div></section>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/account.js"></script>
